* ''The act ward'' (operator asked for the full floor). On the daemon and kahua wikis, an action string runs in a throwaway copy of the wiki, its recorded diff is judged, and a clean diff applies as itself; a code-bearing `meme_act` there refuses outright until the ward stands. User wikis run acts live with full caps. The design rests in <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/kahua-memory-stage#/the-hearth-lane`>>.

